      <description align="left" color="yellow" colored="false" height="150" width="980" x="30" y="840">WS5 slide-based disclosed assumption: five common classification models. HeartDisease positiveYes. FixedSplitSet generated reproducibly by stratified10-fold predictor-profile grouping, seed2026, folds0-2test. Same training/test for allmodels. SplitSetremoved from learners. Encoding/scalingfittraining only and applied to test. Performance exports native_NB/LR/DT/RF/GBT.csv only after actual Run. Keep original heart_2020_cleaned.csv and derived heart_2020_modeling.csv with this RMP. Native Run and relocation still pending.</description>
